  "chapter": "05",
  "anchor": "sec-2"
 },
 {
  "term": "roofline 模型",
  "key": "roofline",
  "en": "roofline model",
  "meaning": "用带宽和算力两块“天花板”画出一段计算最快能跑多快的图。",
  "chapter": "05",
  "anchor": "sec-2"
 },
 {
  "term": "算力",
  "key": "compute-throughput",
  "en": "peak compute (FLOPS)",
  "meaning": "硬件每秒能做多少次浮点运算，单位是 FLOPS。",
  "chapter": "05",
  "anchor": "c05-roofline"
 },
 {
  "term": "拐点",
  "key": "ridge-point",
  "en": "ridge point",
  "meaning": "roofline 图上两块天花板的交点，算术强度低于它就受带宽限制，高于它就受算力限制。",
  "chapter": "05",
  "anchor": "c05-roofline"
 },
 {
  "term": "关键路径",
  "key": "critical-path",
  "en": "critical path",
  "meaning": "依赖图里从头到尾最长的那条链，总时间至少等于它，只有缩短它才能变快。",
  "chapter": "05",
  "anchor": "sec-4"
 },
 {
  "term": "Amdahl 定律",
  "key": "amdahl",
  "en": "Amdahl's law",
  "meaning": "整体加速受未被优化部分的占比限制，局部再快，总加速也有上限。",
  "chapter": "05",
  "anchor": "c05-amdahl"
 },
 {
  "term": "首字延迟",
  "key": "ttft",
  "en": "time to first token (TTFT)",
  "meaning": "从发出请求到看到第一个 token 的时间，包括排队、读题和第一步生成。",
  "chapter": "05",
  "anchor": "sec-6"
 },
 {
  "term": "输出速度",
  "key": "output-speed",
  "en": "output speed (tokens/s)",
