  "meaning": "最简单的激活函数：负数变成 0，正数保持不变。",
  "chapter": "07",
  "anchor": "c07-layer-activation"
 },
 {
  "term": "sigmoid",
  "key": "sigmoid",
  "en": "sigmoid",
  "meaning": "把任意数压到 0 到 1 之间的函数，常用作控制开合程度的“门”。",
  "chapter": "07",
  "anchor": "c07-layer-activation"
 },
 {
  "term": "SiLU",
  "key": "silu",
  "en": "SiLU",
  "meaning": "激活函数 z × sigmoid(z)，像平滑版的 ReLU，负数区域会微微下沉。",
  "chapter": "07",
  "anchor": "c07-layer-activation"
 },
 {
  "term": "QSA",
  "key": "qsa",
  "en": "QSA (Strata sparse attention)",
  "meaning": "Strata 模型里的注意力层，先用索引器挑出前文中相关的位置，只在这些位置上做注意力。",
